WEBVTT

00:11:58.264 --> 00:12:03.481
to get our patients into
the supplemental nutrition program

00:12:03.505 --> 00:12:06.878
known as "food stamps" to most people.

00:12:08.671 --> 00:12:12.308
When patients and doctors
don't understand each other,

00:12:12.332 --> 00:12:14.101
mistakes will occur.

00:12:14.717 --> 00:12:16.665
For non-English-speaking patients,

00:12:16.689 --> 00:12:20.528
translation is as important
as a prescription pad.

00:12:21.208 --> 00:12:22.698
Perhaps more important.

00:12:23.274 --> 00:12:26.143
And, you know, it doesn't
cost anything more

00:12:26.167 --> 00:12:30.984
to put all of the materials
at the level of fourth-grade reading,